b.p('All 175 SQL migrations in the extracted snapshot, ordered by filename. A timestamp establishes repository ordering, not proof it has been applied to production. Preserve migration history and review clean-install and upgrade behavior separately. The newest composition and approval migrations are necessary for their matching source behavior.')
