b.section('Maintaining the blueprint')
b.bullets('Regenerate API/page/model/catalog/schema inventories whenever their source changes; store snapshot date, commit and file hashes.','Update narrative when behavior changes, especially approval modes, billing, provider retirement, media capabilities or source ownership.','Review official model availability and rate cards at each provider change; retain invoices as actual-spend evidence.','Track production facts in a private operational supplement: services, migrations, flags, approved OAuth apps, backups and contacts.','Keep future feature decisions separate from current-state documentation. Move a later catalog item to launch only with an implemented path and verified acceptance evidence.','Retain the editable Markdown companions and machine-readable inventory so a future maintainer can update the series without reconstructing it from PDFs.')
BOOKS.append(b)
